#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:1 7683e1d1f1ee4f2691adaec817a17191
msgid "DFT-D3：统一数据中的色散校正口径"
msgstr "DFT-D3: Make the Dispersion-Correction Convention Consistent"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:3 50e9a86d85f3494cacff3275f02add31
msgid ""
"这个功能直接修改当前数据集的 DFT 参考标签，用于加上或减去 DFT-D3 色散校正。只有明确知道原始数据是否包含 "
"D3、使用了什么交换关联泛函时才运行；不确定时不要靠散点图位置猜。"
msgstr ""
"This operation directly modifies the DFT reference labels in the current "
"dataset by adding or subtracting a DFT-D3 dispersion correction. Run it only "
"when you know whether the source data already include D3 and which "
"exchange-correlation functional was used. Do not infer this from the scatter "
"plot."

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md f9ab7b54cd5d4a0196ddae073fc48ab0
msgid "当前数据"
msgstr "Current data"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md 1b6b58825ba4456393b8519930c6b25c
msgid "目标口径"
msgstr "Target convention"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md e4d66d72a6244464972ecc0bb7d087d2
msgid "选择"
msgstr "Choose"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md 7b726187a1384b9ebb2825cd87e0c612
msgid "不含 D3"
msgstr "Without D3"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md 9c7c1b68ff6b401cbe5c9bd8f3707566
msgid "改成包含 D3"
msgstr "Include D3"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md 861b0fb2802b4c3a974c8d14191bdd79
msgid "`Add DFT-D3`"
msgstr "`Add DFT-D3`"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md 1faf997fe16045a99f85786aede24bdd
msgid "已含 D3"
msgstr "With D3"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md 1580b5330d9e4619b59279c88b6c9cb5
msgid "改成不含 D3"
msgstr "Remove D3"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md 24dca5895faa47dfadeb15a9e099351b
msgid "`Subtract DFT-D3`"
msgstr "`Subtract DFT-D3`"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:10
#: f3d4531be5c54264a150623b06fe63c7
msgid "1. 先保存原始数据"
msgstr "1. Save the original data first"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:12
#: 7b60543d4ef14b98a868225e7c676363
msgid ""
"在 `NEP Dataset Display` 中打开数据和对应的 "
"`nep.txt`，确认当前标签来源与泛函，然后先导出一份原始数据。DFT-D3 会修改 energy、force 以及已有的 "
"virial/stress 标签，而且重复运行会继续累加，没有单独的撤销按钮。"
msgstr ""
"Open the dataset and its corresponding `nep.txt` in `NEP Dataset Display`, "
"confirm the source and functional of the current labels, and export a copy of "
"the original data. DFT-D3 modifies energy, force, and any existing "
"virial/stress labels. Repeating the operation accumulates the correction, and "
"there is no dedicated undo button."

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:14
#: 3fb3e8ca561e49168aa27aec52d8f13a
msgid "能量图和 DFT-D3 校正入口"
msgstr "Energy plot and the DFT-D3 correction action"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:14
#: 3fb3e8ca561e49168aa27aec52d8f13a
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/dft_d3_entry.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/dft_d3_entry.png"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:19
#: b330c1819dba4811b78d14386dd2f89b
msgid "点击工具栏中的 `DFT D3`。该计算固定使用 CPU，与当前选择的 NEP 后端无关。"
msgstr "Click `DFT D3` on the toolbar. This calculation always runs on the CPU, regardless of the selected NEP backend."

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:21
#: 0d9c1dffc1ef4dfcbaf3c249a327dedf
msgid "2. 泛函必须与原计算一致"
msgstr "2. Match the functional used by the original calculation"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:23
#: 1e520dfd2a62495baff27cb54582d4bc
msgid "DFT-D3 校正设置窗口"
msgstr "DFT-D3 correction settings"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:23
#: 1e520dfd2a62495baff27cb54582d4bc
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_dftd3_dialog.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_dftd3_dialog.png"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:28
#: e5e0ffc3104a4a2ca468d837e953bb1b
msgid "图中 `pbe` 只对应 PBE 数据："
msgstr "The `pbe` setting shown here applies only to PBE data:"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:30
#: 5a870c23dad04bfbb077153cdb508344
msgid "第一项填写原始 DFT 计算使用的泛函，例如 `pbe`、`scan` 或 `pbesol`。"
msgstr "In the first field, enter the functional used by the original DFT calculation, such as `pbe`, `scan`, or `pbesol`."

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:31
#: 09e0732b157f4b81a74125ba9025d2ec
msgid "`D3 cutoff` 和 `D3 cutoff_cn` 第一次先保留当前默认值；只有已有计算规范明确要求时才修改。"
msgstr "Keep the current defaults for `D3 cutoff` and `D3 cutoff_cn` on your first run. Change them only when an established calculation protocol explicitly requires different values."

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:32
#: 6603780e88b44658af4b1c3e63d83206
msgid "按目标选择 `Add DFT-D3` 或 `Subtract DFT-D3`。"
msgstr "Choose `Add DFT-D3` or `Subtract DFT-D3` according to the target convention."

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:33
#: 6a1b318745cd471aa034201857990a05
msgid "点击 `OK`，等待全部结构处理完成。"
msgstr "Click `OK` and wait for all structures to be processed."

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:35
#: ee75cf7ff3564a1a80714ac39cff8871
msgid "不要因为模型使用了某种泛函就填写那个名称；这里应与当前 DFT 标签的原始计算口径一致。"
msgstr "Do not enter a functional merely because the model uses it. This field must match the convention of the original DFT labels in the current dataset."

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:37
#: e6d535d6fb8846dea17bd7bd654ae760
msgid "3. 看标签是否按预期改变"
msgstr "3. Check that the labels changed as intended"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:39
#: be3c5b5b5cf649fc936a1850ff1d3dba
msgid "加上 PBE DFT-D3 后的能量图"
msgstr "Energy plot after adding PBE DFT-D3"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:39
#: be3c5b5b5cf649fc936a1850ff1d3dba
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/dft_d3_result.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/dft_d3_result.png"

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:44
#: deb3080a0b53495d97f04bcb67b414e4
msgid ""
"本例真实加上了 PBE DFT-D3，因此参考能量、力和 virial 发生变化，NEP "
"预测本身没有改变。散点更靠近或更远离对角线都不能单独证明操作正确；关键是模式、泛函和原数据口径是否匹配。"
msgstr ""
"This example applies a real PBE DFT-D3 correction, so the reference energy, "
"force, and virial change while the NEP predictions remain unchanged. Points "
"moving closer to or farther from the diagonal does not by itself prove that "
"the operation is correct. What matters is whether the mode, functional, and "
"source-data convention match."

#: ../../source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:46
#: faf95be27de349519484c67399b63e50
msgid "检查完成后用新文件名导出，例如 `train_pbe_d3.xyz`。不要覆盖无法重新获得的原始标签。"
msgstr "After checking the result, export it under a new name such as `train_pbe_d3.xyz`. Do not overwrite original labels that cannot be reproduced."
